@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@userId = u100
@helpId = replace-with-created-help-uuid
@requestKey = replace-with-unique-key-for-this-help

### 发起求助：不要求档案或 Trip；失败重试沿用 requestKey，新求助必须换新 Key
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/help-events
X-Mock-Actor-Id: {{userId}}
X-Mock-Actor-Role: ELDER
Idempotency-Key: {{requestKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "tripId": null,
  "type": "GENERAL",
  "location": null,
  "locationNote": "开发联调演示：入口附近，需要咨询（非真实求助）"
}

### 老人只看自己的求助；复制创建响应 id 到顶部 helpId
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/help-events
X-Mock-Actor-Id: {{userId}}
X-Mock-Actor-Role: ELDER

### 查询当前状态与模拟通知；轮询此接口，不重发创建请求
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/help-events/{{helpId}}
X-Mock-Actor-Id: {{userId}}
X-Mock-Actor-Role: ELDER

### 景区演示接单列表（首期同一个 mock 工作池）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/help-events
X-Mock-Actor-Id: scenic-operator-001
X-Mock-Actor-Role: SCENIC

### 景区人员接单
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/help-events/{{helpId}}/acknowledge
X-Mock-Actor-Id: scenic-operator-001
X-Mock-Actor-Role: SCENIC

### 实际处理人解决；换其他景区操作人会返回 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/help-events/{{helpId}}/resolve
X-Mock-Actor-Id: scenic-operator-001
X-Mock-Actor-Role: SCENIC
